<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Four purposes share this one service, so the config below is the UNION of what
  each needs. None of them disables another.

   1. Process keep-alive — the binding alone gives the app the highest
      process-priority tier so BYD firmware won't kill it (the original purpose).

   2. Physical-key mapping — flagRequestFilterKeyEvents + canRequestFilterKeyEvents
      let onKeyEvent intercept hardware buttons (steering-wheel / dash keys) BEFORE
      the OEM handler, so the user can rebind them. A standard a11y capability:
      no root, no signature permission, no INJECT_EVENTS.

   3. FORK-LOCAL: autostart auto-enable (AutoStartEnabler) drives BYD's
      com.byd.appstartmanagement dialog through the a11y APIs. That dialog is
      mShowToOwnerOnly, so getRootInActiveWindow returns the launcher rather than
      the dialog and uiautomator cannot see it at all — reaching it needs
      canRetrieveWindowContent + flagRetrieveInteractiveWindows. canPerformGestures
      backs the dispatchGesture coordinate-tap fallback, and typeWindowsChanged
      notices the dialog appear (the enabler polls as its primary mechanism, so
      that event is belt-and-suspenders).

   4. Seat-position capture — typeViewLongClicked lets onAccessibilityEvent notice
      the user long-pressing BYD's seat-position buttons to mirror that geometry
      into OverDrive's own store. flagReportViewIds exposes
      getViewIdResourceName() so the match is by resource-id rather than by
      localized button text.

  FORK-LOCAL: the home panel also reads the window list for foreground detection,
  which typeWindowsChanged and flagRetrieveInteractiveWindows (3) already cover.

  notificationTimeout stays at the key filter's 100 ms. A longer value coalesces
  event delivery, which is wrong for a service that also filters hardware keys,
  and nothing else here depends on it.
-->
<accessibility-service xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:description="@string/accessibility_service_description"
    android:accessibilityEventTypes="typeWindowStateChanged|typeWindowsChanged|typeViewLongClicked"
    android:accessibilityFeedbackType="feedbackGeneric"
    android:accessibilityFlags="flagRequestFilterKeyEvents|flagRetrieveInteractiveWindows|flagReportViewIds|flagIncludeNotImportantViews"
    android:canRequestFilterKeyEvents="true"
    android:canRetrieveWindowContent="true"
    android:canPerformGestures="true"
    android:notificationTimeout="100"
    android:settingsActivity="com.overdrive.app.ui.MainActivity" />
